    {
      "path": "/summary",
      "value": "Over 5.9 Years of experience in Software development. Certified Anaplan Model Builder with Intensive experience of 3.5 years as Anaplan Model Builder. Well experienced in end-to-end implementation of Anaplan Models, Modules, Dashboard, workflow, Lists, Actions. Have Experienced with Integration concepts between various Models and working Knowledge of Anaplan Connect. Experienced in Coordinating with onsite team members and development team. Experience in responding to Request for Proposals (RFPs) and good experience in Anaplan Modeling, requirement gathering, solution design, build, Unit testing, debugging and Performance tuning with the industry best standards. Ability to meet deadlines and handle multiple tasks in a pressured environment, proficient in report writing, decisive with strong leadership qualities, flexible in work schedules. Versatile team player with excellent analytical, presentation and interpersonal skills with an aptitude to learn new technologies",
