      "path": "/projects/0/description",
      "value": "Requirement Gathering from key stakeholders to enhance the prebuilt model. Build model including lists, versions, time, modules, and dashboards using Anaplan best practices and optimize the model. Created new model for EXIT Outlet users. Worked on ALM for model and App both. Developed business logics in Anaplan to meet users’ expectations. Designed Exit Outlet model from scratch for outlet users. User Training, Documentation, UAT support. Plan, prepare and execute the unit testing. Prepared the test cases for User Acceptance Testing.",
