    {
      "path": "/projects/2/description",
      "value": "Translated the Business requirements to enterprise models with associated modules, lists/line items, and calculations as supported by multi-dimensional Anaplan platform. Developed several Dashboards like Operational & Reporting Dashboards for better understanding. Experienced in coordinating with the Onsite Team members for optimizing the Business Scenario and accomplish the Project Goals. Expert in using Application Lifecycle Management to manage the Development, Testing & Deployment of our Model. Practiced Anaplan Agile Methodology for planning and execution on project deliverables from requirements.",
      "citation_valid": true,
